cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Code for original HCM SCD CE analysis"
message: "If you use this repository in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Nathan Green"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2745-1736"
repository-code: "https://github.com/n8thangreen/HCMSCDCEanalysis"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
description: |
  This repository contains code, model specifications, and (processed) data 
  to perform a probabilistic cost-effectiveness (CE) analysis of a prognostic 
  model for sudden cardiac death (SCD) in hypertrophic cardiomyopathy (HCM).
keywords:
  - "cost-effectiveness analysis"
  - "hypertrophic cardiomyopathy"
  - "sudden cardiac death"
  - "Bayesian modeling"
  - "health economics"
  - "Markov model"
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  authors:
    - family-names: "O'Mahony"
      given-names: "C."
    - family-names: et al.
  journal: "European Heart Journal"
  title: "A novel clinical risk prediction model for sudden cardiac death in hypertrophic cardiomyopathy (HCM risk-SCD)"
